  "diagnosis": "The 2025-03-31.basil version removed the top\u2011level `payment_intent` field from the Invoice object and introduced a `payments` array that contains payment objects. The original code accessed a now\u2011missing field, causing KeyError. The fix extracts payment intent IDs from `invoice[\"payments\"][\"data\"]`, handling multiple entries, ignoring non\u2011payment_intent types, null or empty values, and supporting both string IDs and expanded objects with an `id` field, matching the vendor change and the local audit policy.",
